# pq-devnet-4 fork digest (optional)
#
# One 8-hex-character operator fork digest for Lean gossip topics.
# Leave empty / commented to use the interim name-hash segment.
# Example (replace with the active run digest):
# aabbccdd
#
# Also accepted via:
#   ethean start --network pq-devnet-4 --fork-digest aabbccdd
#   ETHEAN_FORK_DIGEST=aabbccdd
